<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="By Your Side"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Answer"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPU901603230"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538283048"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>MIREI &amp; Shinko Ogura</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">反正这世间</text><text for="L2">远比我想象的还要残酷</text><text for="L3">不知何时起 连心怀期待</text><text for="L4">都让我心生怯意</text><text for="L5">可身处这般世界的你</text><text for="L6">为何还能坚信未来？在无法倒流的时光里</text><text for="L7">怎能毫不迷惘地迈步前行？</text><text for="L8">所谓满载希望的明天</text><text for="L9">曾被我不屑地斥为荒唐 却被过于向阳的你所感染</text><text for="L10">竟也悄悄扬起了笑意</text><text for="L11">谢谢你 在这心底深处</text><text for="L12">终于发觉了想要传达给你的心意</text><text for="L13">谢谢你 哪怕只有一点点</text><text for="L14">只要有你相伴 仿佛就能变得坦率</text><text for="L15">如今的我还无法好好向你倾诉</text><text for="L16">明明理应是如此简单</text><text for="L17">眼前这片风景</text><text for="L18">之所以比我想象中更加璀璨</text><text for="L19">正是因为希望的存在</text><text for="L20">全是你温柔教会了我</text><text for="L21">呐 听我说 能与你相遇</text><text for="L22">我才初次明了这份心意</text><text for="L23">原来泪水不只在悲哀时刻</text><text for="L24">才会潸然滑落</text><text for="L25">谢谢你 纵然虚渺易碎</text><text for="L26">若是有你相伴的明天 我便能深信</text><text for="L27">谢谢你 越是思念着你</text><text for="L28">想倾诉的万语千言 越是满溢心间</text><text for="L29">换作如今 仿佛终于能够倾诉</text><text for="L30">只要依偎在你的身旁</text><text for="L31">只要身旁有你 我便别无所求 这当真是我发自心底的所想</text><text for="L32">从前总说不出口 只是任性依赖 可今天我不再羞怯</text><text for="L33">也绝不再闪躲掩饰 我要唱给你听</text><text for="L34">多谢你 如今在我胸口深处</text><text for="L35">早已明了那份想要倾诉的深情</text><text for="L36">感谢你 纵使韶华转瞬即逝</text><text for="L37">只要有你在身旁的明日 我定能坚信不疑</text><text for="L38">谢谢你 我最珍视的人</text><text for="L39">若是与你携手 我便敢起誓永恒</text><text for="L40">谢谢你 真的谢谢你</text><text for="L41">将与你描摹的未来紧紧拥入怀中</text><text for="L42">好想再多看看那样的笑靥 只因我深深喜欢你</text><text for="L43">请永远陪伴在我的身旁</text><text for="L44">因为我是如此全心喜欢你</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="5:18.128"><div begin="0:13.723" end="5:18.128"><p begin="0:13.723" end="0:18.113" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:13.723" end="0:14.233">どう</span><span begin="0:14.233" end="0:14.533">せ</span> <span begin="0:14.793" end="0:15.223">こ</span><span begin="0:15.223" end="0:15.503">の</span><span begin="0:15.503" end="0:15.823">世</span><span begin="0:15.823" end="0:17.263">界</span><span begin="0:17.263" end="0:18.113">は</span></p><p begin="0:19.603" end="0:25.083" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.603" end="0:20.233">僕</span><span begin="0:20.233" end="0:20.433">が</span><span begin="0:20.843" end="0:21.573">思</span><span begin="0:21.573" end="0:21.853">う</span><span begin="0:21.853" end="0:22.283">よ</span><span begin="0:22.283" end="0:22.463">り</span><span begin="0:22.463" end="0:22.853">も</span><span begin="0:22.853" end="0:23.693">残</span><span begin="0:23.693" end="0:24.513">酷</span><span begin="0:24.513" end="0:25.083">で</span></p><p begin="0:25.694" end="0:29.944" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:25.694" end="0:25.944">い</span><span begin="0:25.944" end="0:26.114">つ</span><span begin="0:26.114" end="0:26.594">か</span><span begin="0:26.594" end="0:27.014">ら</span><span begin="0:27.014" end="0:27.404">か</span><span begin="0:27.404" end="0:27.644">期</span><span begin="0:27.644" end="0:28.374">待</span><span begin="0:28.374" end="0:28.874">す</span><span begin="0:28.874" end="0:29.004">る</span><span begin="0:29.004" end="0:29.294">こ</span><span begin="0:29.294" end="0:29.944">と</span></p><p begin="0:30.361" end="0:35.941" itu