gin="0:55.038" end="0:55.558">ず</span><span begin="0:55.558" end="0:55.818">に</span><span begin="0:55.818" end="0:56.658">歩</span><span begin="0:56.658" end="0:56.888">け</span><span begin="0:56.888" end="0:57.038">る</span><span begin="0:57.038" end="0:59.008">の？</span></p><p begin="1:00.245" end="1:06.165" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.245" end="1:00.815">希</span><span begin="1:01.405" end="1:01.855">望</span><span begin="1:01.855" end="1:02.295">に</span><span begin="1:02.905" end="1:03.135">満</span><span begin="1:03.135" end="1:03.305">ち</span><span begin="1:03.305" end="1:03.785">た</span><span begin="1:04.015" end="1:05.185">明日</span><span begin="1:05.185" end="1:05.885">なん</span><span begin="1:05.885" end="1:06.165">て</span></p><p begin="1:06.163" end="1:18.873" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.163" end="1:06.733">く</span><span begin="1:07.363" end="1:07.633">だ</span><span begin="1:07.633" end="1:07.743">ら</span><span begin="1:07.743" end="1:08.273">ない</span><span begin="1:08.883" end="1:09.033">と</span> <span begin="1:09.033" end="1:09.243">吐</span><span begin="1:09.243" end="1:09.653">き</span><span begin="1:09.653" end="1:10.263">捨</span><span begin="1:10.263" end="1:10.633">て</span><span begin="1:10.633" end="1:10.903">て</span><span begin="1:10.903" end="1:11.083">い</span><span begin="1:11.083" end="1:11.333">た</span><span begin="1:11.333" end="1:11.843">の</span><span begin="1:11.843" end="1:12.353">に</span> <span begin="1:12.873" end="1:13.493">前</span><span begin="1:13.493" end="1:14.013">向</span><span begin="1:14.013" end="1:14.463">き</span><span begin="1:14.733" end="1:15.073">す</span><span begin="1:15.073" end="1:15.643">ぎる</span><span begin="1:15.643" end="1:16.633">君</span><span begin="1:16.633" end="1:16.993">に</span><span begin="1:16.993" end="1:17.253">つ</span><span begin="1:17.253" end="1:17.833">ら</span><span begin="1:17.833" end="1:18.023">れ</span><span begin="1:18.023" end="1:18.873">て</span></p><p begin="1:19.172" end="1:22.612" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.172" end="1:19.572">少</span><span begin="1:19.572" end="1:20.032">し</span><span begin="1:20.032" end="1:20.652">笑</span><span begin="1:20.652" end="1:20.912">え</span><span begin="1:20.912" end="1:22.612">た</span></p><p begin="1:23.040" end="1:29.270" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.040" end="1:23.370">あ</span><span begin="1:23.370" end="1:23.670">り</span><span begin="1:23.670" end="1:24.050">が</span><span begin="1:24.050" end="1:25.630">とう</span> <span begin="1:25.860" end="1:26.310">こ</span><span begin="1:26.310" end="1:26.630">の</span><span begin="1:26.630" end="1:28.120">胸</span><span begin="1:28.120" end="1:28.330">の</span><span begin="1:28.330" end="1:29.270">中</span></p><p begin="1:29.569" end="1:34.449" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.569" end="1:30.069">伝</span><span begin="1:30.069" end="1:30.329">え</span><span begin="1:30.329" end="1:30.649">た</span><span begin="1:30.649" end="1:30.999">い</span><span begin="1:31.129" end="1:31.919">想</span><span begin="1:31.919" end="1:32.069">い</span><span begin="1:32.069" end="1:32.259">に</span><span begin="1:32.559" end="1:32.939">気</span><span begin="1:32.939" end="1:33.359">付</span><span begin="1:33.359" end="1:33.469">い</span><span begin="1:33.469" end="1:34.089">たん</span><span begin="1:34.089" end="1:34.449">だ</span></p><p begin="1:34.886" end="1:41.116" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.886" end="1:35.226">あ</span><span begin="1:35.226" end="1:35.536">り</span><span begin="1:35.536" end="1:35.906">が</span><span begin="1:35.906" end="1:37.446">とう</span> <span begin="1:37.726" end="1:38.146">ほん</span><span begin="1:38.146" end="1:38.436">の</span><span begin="1:38.436" end="1:39.916">少</span><span begin="1:39.916" end="1:40.226">し</span><span begin="1:40.226" end="1:40.356">だ</span><span begin="1:40.356" end="1:41.116">け</span></p><p begin="1:41.471" end="1:47.081" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><spa